      "title": {
        "en": "Impeccable styling and breed haircuts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners praise the Upper East Side salon for delivering beautiful breed-standard haircuts and gentle spa washes. Pups consistently return home clean, fluffy, and smelling fresh, with several reviewers calling the results magazine-worthy. Rare complaints involve uneven coat lengths or nicked skin on sensitive areas."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive stylists and patient care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The salon team receives warm recommendations for friendly service and attentiveness to specific styling requests. Groomer Min is frequently singled out as a trusted stylist who handles energetic or finicky dogs with exceptional patience. A minority of reviews report communication gaps regarding scheduling delays."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spotless and welcoming boutique atmosphere"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers regularly remark on the clean, modern interior and well-organized grooming stations at this Manhattan location. The boutique environment is described as calm, bright, and hygienic, providing a pleasant setting for dogs. Visitors also appreciate the organized boutique area featuring curated pet accessories."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
